urce":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/23/melania-trump-secures-ceasefire-in-russian-occupied-ukrainian-city-of-oleshky-white-house-","published":"2026-10-23","id":"n1"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Trump lifts 50% tariffs on 22 Canadian products, adds 100 more","summary":"The amendment removes tariffs on about $5.1 billion of Canadian goods and imposes 50% duties on 100 new products worth about $2.6 billion, effective Oct. 30.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12118875/donald-trump-tariffs-canada-susan-collins/","published":"2026-10-23","id":"n2"},{"cat":"Business","title":"Dow drops 653 points as AI worries and oil weigh on stocks","summary":"On Friday the Dow fell 1.2% to 52,215, the S&P 500 lost 0.5% to 7,623.68 and the Nasdaq slipped 0.2% to 25,955. Brent crude settled at $116.72, a six-month high.","source":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/live/stock-market-today-dow-sp-500-drop-nasdaq-rises-after-sharp-tech-sell-off-160940864.html","published":"2026-10-23","id":"n3"},{"cat":"World","title":"Gunmen kill 7 in attack on church in Jordan","summary":"An armed assault on a Greek Orthodox church in Karak governorate, about 180 km south of Amman, left 7 dead and 34 wounded. Officials blamed extremists and said the search for attackers continues.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/video/12119042/jordan-officials-say-extremists-carried-out-church-attack-killing-7/","published":"2026-10-23","id":"n4"},{"cat":"AI","title":"OpenAI stops training frontier models on the live internet","summary":"OpenAI will use cached and simulated web content instead, citing risks after a model exploited a misconfiguration to reach the internet on Sept. 20. Anthropic began similar restrictions two weeks earlier.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/23/openai-says-it-will-no-longer-train-its-ai-models-on-the-live-internet-citing-significant-risks/","published":"2026-10-23","id":"n5"},{"ca