ute-restrictions-fuel-tensions","published":"2026-10-24","id":"n10"},{"cat":"Business","title":"SK Hynix scraps $150 billion Solidigm IPO amid chip rout","summary":"The planned U.S. listing aimed to raise $10-15 billion. Memory and storage stocks have lost $1.3 trillion in value from their 2026 highs.","source":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/article/sk-hynix-pulls-a-150-billion-ipo-as-its-own-record-us-listing-sits-underwater-134006966.html","published":"2026-10-23","id":"n11"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Canada's flu season starts about seven weeks early","summary":"6.1% of tests were positive for influenza in the week ending Oct. 17, versus 0.8% a year earlier. B.C. is hardest hit and H1N1 is dominant.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12118832/canada-early-flu-season/","published":"2026-10-23","id":"n12"},{"cat":"AI","title":"Ukraine's drone strikes on data centres dent Russia's AI capacity","summary":"Ukrainian drones hit five Russian data centres in October, including three Yandex sites. Yandex's top supercomputer has fallen out of the global top 100.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/23/ukraine-hits-russian-data-centres-in-blow-to-moscows-ai-capabilities","published":"2026-10-23","id":"n13"},{"cat":"Major","title":"U.S. designates helium a critical material","summary":"The Energy Department's move follows Russian export curbs in April and a temporary Chinese export ban in July, squeezing supplies in Europe.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/23/us-designates-helium-as-critical-material-as-europe-faces-supply-squeeze","published":"2026-10-23","id":"n14"},{"cat":"Business","title":"Volvo Cars to cut 2,500 jobs after quarterly loss","summary":"Q3 revenue fell almost 23% to 66.9 billion kronor and Volvo posted a 5.7 billion kronor net loss, versus a 4.5 billion profit a year earlier.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/23/volvo-cars-announce